# cads - fakes cads-data-service. Every route needs x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}.

### Animal details (LANI-802)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals/{{animalId}}
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animal details - dead animal (state: Dead, dateOfDeath)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals/{{deadAnimalId}}
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animal details - not found (404 ProblemDetails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals/UK999999999999
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding (LANI-803, PaginatedResult<T>)
# order / sort / q / holdingAssociation are accepted but ignored; results are ear-tag ascending.
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals?CPH={{cph}}
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding - paged
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals?CPH={{cph}}&page=2&pageSize=5
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding - cancelled holding (200 with empty results, not 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals?CPH={{cancelledCph}}
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding - unknown CPH (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals?CPH=99/999/9999
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding - missing CPH (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Animals on holding - bad page (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals?CPH={{cph}}&page=x
x-api-key: {{cadsApiKey}}

### Unauthorized - no x-api-key (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cads/api/v1/bovine/animals/{{animalId}}
